      "content": "Wait, 10ml?? i just looked at the bottle and it says the max dose for a kid his size is usually around 7 or 8ml. also, you said the acetaminophen will help with the swelling? i thought that was just for pain and fever. is it actually safe to give him 10ml if he's also having this rash and swelling? i'm really worried the swelling might be an allergy or something serious.",
