      "content": "okay 7ml sounds more reasonable. but he's starting to make a slight wheezing sound when he breathes and he looks a bit more flushed now. my husband is saying we should just head to the ER right this second because of the swelling and the breathing, but i'm so far from the hospital and i don't want to make a huge scene if it's just a reaction to the fever. are you sure the 7ml isn't enough to handle this? what if the swelling is actually getting worse and he needs something stronger right now?",
